== slurp:
-c:1:1: error: Builtin `slurp`: Not enough arguments.
     1 |  slurp
       |  ^~~~~
note: Try `slurp --help` for more info.
rc=2
== slurp +3:
-c:1:7: error: Builtin `slurp`: A line number needs a file after it.
     1 |  slurp +3
       |        ^~
note: Pass the file to open, e.g. `slurp +12 notes.txt`.
rc=2
== slurp a +3:
-c:1:9: error: Builtin `slurp`: A line number needs a file after it.
     1 |  slurp a +3
       |          ^~
note: Pass the file to open, e.g. `slurp +12 notes.txt`.
rc=2
== slurp -e -v a:
-c:1:10: error: Builtin `slurp`: Only one key set option can be given.
     1 |  slurp -e -v a
       |           ^~
note: Pass one of -e, -v, or -V.
rc=2
== slurp --emacs --vi a:
-c:1:15: error: Builtin `slurp`: Only one key set option can be given.
     1 |  slurp --emacs --vi a
       |                ^~~~
note: Pass one of -e, -v, or -V.
rc=2
== slurp -v -V a:
-c:1:10: error: Builtin `slurp`: Only one key set option can be given.
     1 |  slurp -v -V a
       |           ^~
note: Pass one of -e, -v, or -V.
rc=2
== slurp --mode vi a:
-c:1:7: error: Builtin `slurp`: Unknown flag '--mode'.
     1 |  slurp --mode vi a
       |        ^~~~~~
note: Use `--` before an operand that begins with a dash.
rc=2
== slurp a b:
-c:1:1: error: Builtin `slurp`: The line editor needs a terminal.
     1 |  slurp a b
       |  ^~~~~~~~~
note: Run slurp with a terminal on both streams.
rc=1
== koshkit slurp:
-c:1:1: error: Builtin `slurp`: Not enough arguments.
     1 |  koshkit slurp
       |  ^~~~~~~~~~~~~
note: Try `slurp --help` for more info.
rc=2
== koshkit vi -e a:
-c:1:9: error: Builtin `slurp`: Only one key set option can be given.
     1 |  koshkit vi -e a
       |          ^~
note: Pass one of -e, -v, or -V.
rc=2
